# Stage 7 Hackl (D-097, D-081): the Hackl carried into Strobl, axes on the
# Postbus and on a car (both Bounce). Title flow with the run started at St.
# Wolfgang: qa_m5_flow_hackl_wolfgangsee_to_strobl's inputs (St. Wolfgang
# and the Wolfgangsee as Hackl, Wolfgangsee clear at 10885), then idle: the
# tally, the route map Wolfgangsee -> Strobl in Wait (from ~11391) and the
# Strobl intro (~11777, `player_hackl`); play starts at 11928 as Hackl.
# In Strobl (clock = frame - 11927): an axe defeats Nordic-Walker #1 (clock
# 345); a route found by a scratch beam search over the shutters and the
# annex to the Dorfplatz (850); onto shelter B, the Postbus triggers and
# halts at 115-118; down to the street, an axe at the halted bus bounces
# off it (1218); back up onto the shelter while it drives on. On along the
# road under the Gastgarten terrace: Ampel #1 starts (1880), an axe thrown
# just before its first car leaves the mouth bounces off the car (1939)
# while she jumps up onto the terrace; she keeps the Hackl throughout.
